# 默认拒绝：任何新文件都不会意外进入仓库
*
!*/

# 允许提交的顶层文档
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!PRIVACY.md
!SECURITY.md
!SKILL.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# 允许提交的代码与文档目录内容
!scripts/*.py
!scripts/*.md
!references/*.md
!docs/*.md
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!.github/workflows/*.yaml

# 模板与演示数据：只放行明确的白名单后缀
!assets/templates/*.example
!assets/templates/*.md
!assets/demo/*.json
!assets/demo/*.md
!example/*.html
!example/stocks/*.html
!example/*.md

# 明确排除（即使路径命中上面的规则）
.sandbox/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.zip
*.yaml
*.yml
!*.example
!*.yaml.example
!/.github/workflows/*.yml
!/.github/workflows/*.yaml
*.json
!assets/demo/*.json
!example/*.json
hosts.yml
*_token*
*.pem
*.key
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
# 唯一例外：README 用图，必须是 demo 实例截图（虚构数据），见 docs/screenshots.md
!docs/screenshots/*.png
*.gif
*.pdf
*.csv
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.env.*
